арианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Age </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients age is between 28 days and 5 years</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients age is less than or equal to 28 days</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients age is more than 5 years</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.HIVstatus\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.HIVstatus </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients HIV status is negative or unknown</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients HIV status is positive</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.CurrentlyonART\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.CurrentlyonART </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is currently not receiving antiretroviral therapy</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is currently receiving antiretroviral therapy</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Immunologicallystable\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Immunologicallystable </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is immunologically stable</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is not immunologically stable</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.TBinfectiontestresult\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.TBinfectiontestresult </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients TB infection test result is negative</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients TB infection test result is positive</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Clients TB infection test result is unknown (test not done or no result yet)</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Timepassedsincealivevaccinewasadministered\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Timepassedsincealivevaccinewasadministered </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Live vaccine was administered in the last four weeks</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No live vaccine was administered</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No live vaccine was administered in the last four weeks</li></ul><a name=\"ru-opt-item.input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Clinicallywell\"> </a><p><b>Варианты ответов для input.DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCG.Clinicallywell </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is clinically well</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Client is not clinically well</li></ul></div><div xml:lang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><hr/><p><b>Spanish</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Cuestionario DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCGQuestionnaire</b></p><a name=\"es-DAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCGQuestionnaire\"> </a><a name=\"es-hcDAK.DT.IMMZ.D2.DT.BCGQuestionnaire\"> </a><b>Structure</b><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana; vertical-align: top;\"><tr style=\"border: 2px #F0F0F0 solid; font-size: 11px; font-family: verdana; vertical-align: top\"><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The linkID for the item\">LinkID</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Text for the item\">Text</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 1px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the item can appear in the instance\">Cardinality</a></th><th style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left)